        "text_WKr8cp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This collection was photographed at The Gallery Inn in Puerto Rico, a singular place layered with art, history, music, and the spirit of the sea. In its weathered walls, winding terraces, and stunning courtyards, we found a setting that reflects something familiar: the shared character of coastlines everywhere — sun-washed colors, patina, and the enduring ease of summer by the water.</p><p>This season turns toward the New England coast — a reflection on the place we call home, shaped by salt air, shoreline colors, and a long tradition of coastal summers.</p><p>Get inspired by viewing the <a href=\"https://shop.misha-and-puff.com/blogs/journal/child-summer-26\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://shop.misha-and-puff.com/blogs/journal/child-summer-26\">lookbook </a>— and browse, favorite, and plan your looks. Part 2 of the Summer Collection launches May 14 at 10 AM ET, online and at our <a href=\"https://ctrk.klclick.com/l/01KJD7J4C1BWNYE7J5G1C4KTBF_9\" target=\"_blank\">Brooklyn store</a>.</p>",
